Derek, Last week, we shared our ambitious end-of-quarter fundraising goal: We need 100,000 Democrats to [pitch in to the DNC between now and Monday at midnight.](https://ak.democrats.org/go/14417?refcode=em_20250328_3081_fr&amount=3&t=1&akid=3083%2E22930333%2EJ2isIK) That number isn’t something we made up. It’s what we need to in order to:
1. Reach as many undecided voters as we can in states like Wisconsin and Florida ahead of Tuesday’s special elections;
2. Continue holding town halls across the country and listening to people’s concerns directly;
3. Lay the groundwork to take back Congress in 2026 and the White House in 2028;
4. And so much more.

**We’ve seen a strong swell of support in the last few days, but we still need more Democrats to step up today to stay on track.** [Can we count on you to be one of the 100,000 supporters we need and to chip in a $3 donation ahead of our end-of-quarter deadline? Your donation will make all the difference in the fights that lie ahead.](https://ak.democrats.org/go/14417?refcode=em_20250328_3081_fr&amount=3&t=2&akid=3083%2E22930333%2EJ2isIK) **[CONTRIBUTE $3](https://secure.actblue.com/donate/em-dnc-march-2025?refcode=em_20250328_3081_fr&amount=3&refcode2=3083_22930333_J2isIK&akid=3083%2E22930333%2EJ2isIK)** Thank you for everything, The Democrats

_If you gave recently via check or mail, our system may not have yet processed your gift. We are appreciative and thank you greatly for your support._
